	'k143c4b88' => 'Fire and smoke assessment',
	'k14451498' => 'Satei Adjusters, located at Unit 3, 41 Canal Wharf, Bristol BS1 6XN, United Kingdom, acts as a data controller and processor for information gathered during loss-adjusting instructions. We collect policyholder names, property addresses, telephone numbers, and email details solely to coordinate site visits and record physical property damage. Processing is conducted exclusively to perform our contractual loss-adjusting obligations to the instructing insurer, in compliance with United Kingdom data protection legislation.',
