	'k16990663' => 'In 2023, Amara Nwosu and Jonas Pike attended a kitchen fire in a residential flat situated above a commercial bakery in Cardiff. Fire and smoke adjuster Amara assessed the primary fire origin, mapping soot deposition and heavy combustion residue across two affected rooms. Working alongside her, Jonas compiled a detailed contents inventory comprising exactly 212 individual items, distinguishing between salvageable effects and irreparably smoke-damaged furnishings. The desk finalized and submitted the comprehensive technical report to the appointing insurer on day 5.',
	'k1aec3064' => 'Waitlist requests are deleted twelve months after the last contact unless you become an appointed panel member.',
