	'k2a243998' => 'Before any building fabric is stripped out or discarded, we capture comprehensive records of the physical damage. We take detailed photographs of affected structures, gather calibrated moisture readings across wall and floor surfaces, complete a structured room-by-room damage sheet, and compile a contents list. Gathering these factual observations while everything remains in situ establishes clear evidence that prevents ambiguity during subsequent claim processing.',
