	'ka05f825b' => 'Physical damage records—including on-site digital photographs, moisture meter measurements, room-by-room damage sheets, and contents inventories compiled by Jonas Pike or our adjusters—are stored in secure digital claim archives. Reports edited by Lin Qiao are transmitted directly to the appointing insurer and are never sold, monetized, or shared with third-party marketing entities, builders, or unassociated repair networks. Records are retained strictly in accordance with statutory insurance audit requirements before secure deletion.',
