	'ka321c12a' => '1. The call',
	'ka662866f' => 'and one phone.',
	'ka7703151' => 'When an insurer contacts our Bristol desk, Ruth Abernethy confirms the appointment the same working day. We review the preliminary instruction details, confirm property access arrangements, and establish the specific nature of the incident. Prompt scheduling ensures that all parties understand the immediate timeline. By locking in attendance right away, we prevent uncoordinated site interventions and set expectations for the insured property owner from the outset.',
	'ka7a4c5da' => 'with insurers.',
	'ka87c7eb5' => 'These terms govern all loss-adjusting instructions, desk reviews, site visits, and technical reporting services provided by Satei Adjusters to commissioning insurance companies. All services are rendered subject to independent professional standards.',
	'kaa432ae8' => 'Our office is located at Canal Wharf in Bristol, handling instructions and insurer liaison across South West England and South Wales. Please contact our desk directly during operational hours to schedule a claim visit or discuss panel availability.',
	'kab8b09eb' => 'Our complete written report is delivered to the appointing insurer within 5 working days of the physical site inspection. Lin Qiao edits each report to verify factual accuracy and clarity. The document includes high-resolution photographs, calibrated moisture diagrams, a room-by-room damage breakdown, and causation notes, providing claims handlers with everything required to progress settlement without administrative back-and-forth. Reports are sent securely via email directly to the handler.',
	'kabc0d318' => 'We attend domestic and commercial properties across South West England and South Wales to document damage before any drying equipment or demolition begins. Every site visit follows four clear stages from the initial instruction to the final written report.',
	'kacb5701a' => 'Contents and technical editing',
	'kaf0411bb' => 'Are your fees billed per hour or as fixed amounts?',
	'kafaa9b02' => 'Lin Qiao',
	'kb1525c7b' => 'answered.',
	'kb1f0b866' => 'Cases',
	'kb21c391f' => 'Calls',
	'kb38d372f' => 'Samir Haddad · 64 m² of laminate · report on day 3',
	'kb3cb2c14' => '2. Kitchen fire, flat above a bakery',
	'kb3dd3dc9' => '64 m² of floor<br>Report on day 3',
	'kb446e5dc' => 'See the fees →',
	'kb4943895' => 'An adjuster attends site within 48 working hours of the instruction being confirmed by our desk. Ruth Abernethy confirms all incoming appointments the same working day, liaising with the policyholder to establish access. Site visits take place Monday to Saturday between 08:00 and 17:00, allowing us to attend promptly before stripping out or temporary modifications alter the physical loss evidence. This fast response keeps claim investigations on track.',
	'kb4e5531c' => 'Carries out building re-inspections and flooring investigations before repair schedules begin.',
	'kb6a9b738' => 'You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold by emailing <a href="mailto:desk@satei-adjusters.example">desk@satei-adjusters.example</a>.',
	'kb7a6b1a7' => 'Back to the home page →',
	'kb7e5882b' => '3. Damp and mould',
	'kb87b86a8' => 'Liability',
	'kb8833e0b' => 'Visit in 48 h',
	'kb8da6df1' => 'Panel',
	'kb90d5a8a' => 'Our practice is deliberately kept small and focused. Seven specialists handle every file directly, working from Unit 3 at Canal Wharf: Every phone call is answered directly at our Bristol desk, ensuring instructing insurers speak immediately with people who know the active files.',
	'kb9924747' => 'No repair firm',
	'kba64026e' => 'GBP, excl. VAT, billed to the insurer. Travel within our ninety-minute operating radius from Bristol is included in all visit fees.',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbc634985' => 'appointment.',
	'kbd786909' => '1. Escape of water',
	'kbe77303c' => '2. Kitchen fire, flat above a bakery, Cardiff (2023)',
	'kbecde975' => '3. Ninety minutes from Bristol',
	'kc0c04998' => 'Founder, chartered loss adjuster (water and buildings)',
	'kc15da07a' => 'The appointing insurer pays our fees directly. Policyholders never pay us, and we never collect excess or private fees.',
	'kc2ba7e78' => 'Service',
	'kc38f6a90' => 'Our fee schedule applies across all instructions: desk review of a claim file based on photos and documents with no visit is £180; standard site visit for escape of water up to two rooms is £420; extended site visit for three or more rooms or two storeys is £690; fire and smoke assessment including soot and odour notes is £860; contents inventory per half day on site is £340; re-inspection after drying for one visit with readings and photos is £260. All fees are billed in GBP to the insurer, with one fee per visit agreed before we go.',
	'kc593fdc8' => 'To maintain forty-eight-hour response times and thorough site inspections, our desk limits active insurer relationships to at most twelve panels at a time.',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc66fb425' => '212 items listed<br>Report on day 5',
	'kc6d04fae' => '1. Appointment',
	'kc78a677b' => 'Waitlist form and response times',
	'kc7accd87' => 'Information on this site',
	'kc7b58c4b' => 'Insurers can apply to join our panel waitlist to secure dedicated adjusting capacity across South West England and South Wales. We review all waitlist submissions in the order they are received and confirm receipt within one working day.',
	'kc849dba7' => 'three or more rooms, or two storeys',
	'kc94aced4' => 'Before any strip-out or demolition begins, we document the true baseline condition through calibrated moisture readings, room-by-room damage schedules, contents inventories, and dated photographs.',
	'kc9eceeda' => 'policy.',
	'kca69a281' => 'Our site visits take place Monday to Saturday between 08:00 and 17:00 across our defined territory within 90 minutes\' drive of Bristol. We serve domestic and commercial claims throughout South West England and South Wales. All claim instructions confirmed by our desk receive attendance within 48 working hours. Because we operate strictly on instruction from insurers, policyholders seeking status updates should liaise directly with their insurer\'s designated claims handler.',
	'kcbf456c0' => 'Unit 3, 41 Canal Wharf<br>Bristol BS1 6XN, United Kingdom',
	'kcc550639' => 'When you email the desk we keep your name, firm, email address and the content of your message. The website itself sets no advertising or tracking cookies.',
