	'kd0d1f5a6' => 'Water and fire field adjusters',
	'kd0fbda98' => 'Page not found',
	'kd162325d' => 'Detailed evaluations of charring, soot distribution, and persistent smoke odour across all affected rooms.',
	'kd1e9939f' => '2. Panel terms',
	'kd28113a4' => '2. The visit',
	'kd31be71e' => 'Panel terms',
	'kd39822a5' => 'Re-inspections following structural drying are billed at the separate fixed rate of £260 per visit. When drying equipment has concluded its cycle, building surveyor Samir Haddad or an attending adjuster returns to site to take secondary moisture readings and photographic verification. This ensures the structure has returned to baseline equilibrium before repair contractors re-board or redecorate affected spaces. A concise re-inspection report is submitted to the insurer.',
	'kd399f38b' => 'Governing law',
	'kd404a201' => 'Re-inspection after drying',
	'kd474f67c' => 'contents tags',
	'kd4c8c187' => 'per half day on site',
	'kd5f806b8' => 'Mon–Sat 08:00–17:00',
	'kd6e5467d' => 'How are re-inspections after drying handled?',
	'kd7a2bc69' => 'An adjuster is on site within 48 working hours of the appointment. Our coverage spans locations within 90 minutes\' drive of Bristol, across South West England and South Wales. Site visits operate Monday to Saturday between 08:00 and 17:00. Arriving swiftly allows us to examine the unaffected parts of the building alongside the compromised areas, observing the exact initial environment before any temporary alterations occur.',
	'kd7dc9222' => 'How a visit runs',
	'kd804284c' => 'More than 60',
	'kda4759eb' => 'Four places open',
	'kda86271e' => 'To preserve report turnaround and field availability, our desk works with at most 12 insurers at a time. We do not overcommit our team or dilute our coverage area. Four panel places will open in April 2027, and requests join our waitlist strictly in the order received. Partner insurers gain direct access to our specialist adjusting team across escape of water, fire, smoke, and contents assessments.',
