	'ke858d54b' => 'Is travel included within your coverage area?',
	'ke9244839' => 'Confirms appointments the same working day and keeps the field calendar from Canal Wharf.',
	'ke95dc4e5' => 'We act as an independent loss-adjusting desk based at Bristol\'s Canal Wharf. Insurers call us when they require clear, unvarnished facts from the scene of an escape of water or fire incident. Because we never handle repairs or accept contingent fees, our findings remain objective and trusted by all parties.',
	'kea15b386' => 'Unit 3, 41 Canal Wharf, Bristol<br>Phone lines Mon–Fri 08:00–18:00',
	'kea9fb7d1' => 'Do you carry out building repairs or strip-out work?',
	'keb7297e9' => 'Fee',
	'kefca77e5' => 'Independent loss adjusting · Bristol',
	'kf074e547' => 'We are not the insurer.',
	'kf0d24bba' => 'Operating hours and coverage radius',
	'kf2834199' => '1. Basement flood, terraced house',
	'kf2c71f8c' => 'We issue invoices monthly directly to the instructing insurer\'s claims department. Each monthly statement provides a consolidated summary referencing individual claim file numbers, visit dates, adjuster names, and specific service categories. Because each fee is agreed before we go, claims handlers experience straightforward invoice reconciliation without unexpected disbursements, time-sheet disputes, or retrospective fee adjustments. Payment terms follow standard commercial agreements established upon panel acceptance.',
	'kf3176df7' => 'Helen Marsh founded Satei Adjusters in 2014 as an independent desk in Bristol. As a chartered loss adjuster specializing in water and buildings, she oversees major complex losses and structural assessments across South West England. Working alongside her, Samir Haddad acts as our building surveyor. Samir specializes in structural evaluations, defect tracing, and post-drying re-inspections, ensuring moisture equilibrium is scientifically confirmed before any building reinstatement proceeds.',
	'kf353b295' => '3. Sprinkler leak, small office',
	'kf4c6f851' => 'Notes',
	'kf5f3d264' => 'Appointment procedure',
	'kf6bc95a7' => 'Satei Adjusters accepts appointments solely from authorized insurance companies for incidents located within 90 minutes\' drive of Bristol. Founded in 2014, our desk maintains complete operational independence from repair contractors, builders, and drying networks. Our appointments are strictly limited to damage investigation, moisture diagnostic measurement, contents inventory logging, and factual reporting. We do not approve policy coverage, authorize cash settlements, or contract building remediation works on behalf of policyholders or insurers.',
	'kf6e90f06' => 'Four panel places open in April 2027. Requests join the waitlist in the order received, and we reply within one working day.',
	'kf7fc290a' => 'Data controller and claim information',
	'kf832ee31' => 'A burst pipe under a cellar stair flooded the lower ground floor. Tomás mapped moisture levels and scheduled drying; a second visit after nineteen days confirmed the timber had normalised.',
	'kf96e383a' => 'to report.',
	'kf984a0d9' => 'The desk works with no more than twelve insurers at a time, so every appointment gets an adjuster and a report on time.',
	'kf98b6023' => 'Scheduling and insurer liaison (answers the phone)',
	'kfbb3dec8' => 'Yes. Travel costs are fully included for all instructions located within our defined operating boundary of 90 minutes\' drive from our Bristol desk. We do not bill mileage surcharges, congestion fees, or travel hours for visits undertaken across South West England and South Wales. The fixed fee confirmed at appointment represents the total professional charge for our site attendance. Insurers receive clear cost certainty before our team departs.',
	'kfc975cd5' => 'Reviews each claim file and edits every written report before it goes to the insurer.',
	'kfe824b31' => 'No. Satei Adjusters is an independent loss-adjusting desk, not a repair firm, builder, or restoration contractor. We do not provide building works, strip-out labour, or drying equipment hire, nor are we owned by any repair franchise. Our sole objective is to inspect the damage, record impartial technical facts, and compile clear evidence so that insurers and their chosen contractors can proceed.',
